      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ORMs and front-end frameworks are great at killing performance.\nYou will always have bloated SQL and overbinded UI by default.\nBut there are always places to pay attention to reduce them.",
